==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{term|esteindre|lang=frm}}, {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|estaindre|lang=fro}} < {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|extinguere|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|extinguō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-éteindre.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/e.tɛ̃dʁ/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[turn off]] (a switch)
# to [[put out]] (a fire)
# {{context|reflexive|lang=fr}} to [[die out]], [[fade]]

